            "en": "Just warm up the leftovers — I'm not cooking again.",
            "zh": "把剩菜热一下就行，我不想再做一遍。"
          }
        },
        {
          "zh": "运动前热身",
          "en": "to prepare your body for exercise",
          "example": {
            "en": "Warm up for five minutes before you start running.",
            "zh": "跑步前先热身五分钟。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "l1_note": "加热是 heat up / warm up，不是 hot the food（中式）。",
      "confusables": [
        "heat up",
        "cool down"
      ],
      "collocations": [
        "warm up leftovers",
        "warm up before a run"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cut-down-on",
      "head": "cut down on",
      "base": "cut",
      "particle": "down",
      "ipa": "ˈkʌt daʊn ɑn",
      "tier": 1,
      "level": "B1",
      "chip": "dining",
      "register": "spoken",
      "separable": false,
