            "en": "I'm trying to cut down on sugar this month.",
            "zh": "我这个月想少吃点糖。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "l1_note": "“减少”不是 reduce down（冗余）；cut down on 后面才跟对象。",
      "confusables": [
        "cut back on",
        "cut out"
      ],
      "collocations": [
        "cut down on salt",
        "cut down on screen time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pig-out",
