        {
          "zh": "放开吃很多",
          "en": "to eat a lot in an uncontrolled way",
          "example": {
            "en": "We pigged out on hot pot and didn't move for an hour.",
            "zh": "我们火锅吃到撑，一小时没动。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "confusables": [
        "eat up",
        "binge"
      ],
      "collocations": [
        "pig out on snacks",
        "pig out at a buffet"
      ],
      "l1_note": "暴吃是自嘲说法；pig out on 后面接食物。"
    },
